# TDD Implementation Plan: Phase 1 Intro Section

## Goal
Recreate **"I Am Machine" by Thomas Schumacher & Lilly Palmer** (Bars 1-16) using TDD.

**Reference**: [assets/audio/reference/I_AM_MACHINE_LILLY_PALMER.mp3](file:///Users/alexzh/ableton-mcp/assets/audio/reference/I_AM_MACHINE_LILLY_PALMER.mp3)

---

## Benchmark Comparison

| Lane | Our Recreation | Reference Stem |
|------|----------------|----------------|
| Drums | `/intro-drums` | `stems/drums.wav` |
| Bass | `/intro-bass` | `stems/bass.wav` |
| Synths | `/intro-synths` | `stems/other.wav` |
| Vocals | `/intro-vocals` | `stems/vocals.wav` |

**Stem Separation**: Use Ableton Suite's built-in feature or Demucs.

---

## TDD Approach

```
RED    → Write failing test
GREEN  → Minimum code to pass
REFACTOR → Clean up
```

---

