## Justfile Targets

```bash
# Run all Phase 1 tests
just test-phase1

# Run specific lane
just test-lane-drums
just test-lane-bass

# TDD workflow
just tdd track=kick    # Watch mode for one track
```

---

## Execution Order (Bottom-Up TDD)

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Sprint 0: P0 Tools] --> B[Lane 1: Drums]
    A --> C[Lane 2: Bass]
    A --> D[Lane 3: Synths]
    A --> E[Lane 4: Vocals]
    B --> F[Integration: Intro Section]
    C --> F
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G[Verify vs Reference]
```

